UPDATE companies SET description='Parts Score operates from the Scottsdale Airpark in Scottsdale, Arizona. The shop was established in 2010 by Jason, who brought over 15 years of European automotive experience to the venture. It is run as a family-owned business, with the owners directly accessible to customers.

The company provides a full range of services for Audi, BMW, and Volkswagen vehicles. Its work spans scheduled preventative maintenance and routine repairs — such as brake jobs and timing belt replacements — to high-end performance modifications. These include coilover and spring installations, big brake kit upgrades, supercharger and air suspension installations, engine swaps, and complete custom show car builds. In-house custom fabrication supports one-off projects, and the shop stocks and sources both OEM replacement parts and aftermarket performance components from brands such as KW Suspension, BBS, CTS Turbo, and Burger Tuning.

The customer base consists of European car owners and enthusiasts seeking everything from daily-driver reliability to bespoke performance builds. Projects documented by the shop include a Brooklyn Grey G80 with KW suspension and 1000M wheels, a dyno-tuned Ferrari SF90, a Rosso Corsa BMW M4 with BBS wheels and a stage 2 package, and an Audi RS5 fitted with ABT Sportsline, AWE Tuning, and HRE components. The shop also serves BMW X3M, M4CS, and M5CS models with tuning, exhaust, and suspension upgrades.

Parts Score emphasizes its family-run structure as a differentiator: one of the owners is always available to discuss a project, and the team describes its approach as treating automotive performance as an art form. The company states it aims to deliver the highest quality parts and service at competitive rates, with personal, friendly, and prompt customer service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Scheduled preventative maintenance", "Brake service and repair", "Timing belt replacement", "Performance modifications", "Coilover and spring installation", "Big brake kit installation", "Supercharger installation", "Air suspension installation (AccuAir)", "Engine swaps", "Custom show car builds", "In-house custom fabrication", "OEM parts supply", "Aftermarket performance parts supply", "Dyno tuning"], "industries": ["European automotive performance", "Automotive aftermarket", "Automotive service and repair"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-run business with an owner always available to customers", "In-house custom fabrication for one-off performance builds", "Stocks and sources OEM and aftermarket performance parts from brands such as KW Suspension, BBS, and CTS Turbo", "Personal, friendly, and prompt customer service at competitive rates"], "facts_used": ["Location: Scottsdale, AZ (Scottsdale Airpark) -> /", "Founded 2010 -> /about-us", "Founder Jason with 15 years experience -> /about-us", "Family-run business, owner always available -> /, /about-us", "Services: maintenance, repairs, performance mods, custom fabrication -> /, /about-us", "Brands: KW Suspension, BBS, CTS Turbo, Burger Tuning, etc. -> /", "Project examples: G80, SF90, M4, RS5, X3M, M4CS, M5CS -> /", "Differentiators: family-run, art approach, quality parts, competitive rates, personal service -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Parts Score is a European Automotive Performance Shop specializing in Audi, BMW and Volkswagen performance modification, performance parts and service.", "founded_year": "2010", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='parts-score' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Partsmax Auto Parts and Accessories operates from Miami, Florida, where it has supplied the South Florida automotive aftermarket for over two decades.

The distributor stocks a broad range of import and domestic auto body parts, heavy-duty truck components, and accessories from refurbished, aftermarket, high-performance, and rebuilt lines. The catalog includes frame machines, auto body shop tools, and fastener removal sets alongside standard replacement panels.

The company offers dedicated wholesale accounts and emphasizes competitive pricing against OEM alternatives.

Partsmax differentiates itself through an expansive in-stock inventory, a favorable return policy, online order tracking, and weekly additions to its catalog.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wholesale distribution of aftermarket auto parts", "Online retail of auto body parts and accessories", "Inventory stocking (250,000+ sq ft warehouse)", "Order tracking and returns processing", "Customer support", "Weekly new product additions"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Collision repair", "Heavy duty truck", "Auto body repair", "Automotive wholesale"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["250,000+ sq ft warehouse inventory", "Thousands of auto body and heavy-duty truck parts in stock", "Wholesale pricing and dedicated accounts", "Favorable return policy with online tracking", "Weekly new product additions"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Partsmax Auto Parts and Accessories -> db", "Headquarters: Miami, Florida -> db", "Over 20 years serving South Florida -> /", "250,000 sq ft warehouse -> /", "Distributes aftermarket, refurbished, high-performance, rebuilt auto parts from manufacturers -> /", "Offers wholesale accounts -> /", "Pickup-only fulfillment (no delivery) -> /", "Competitive pricing on import and domestic parts -> /", "Favorable return policy and online tracking -> /", "Weekly inventory additions -> /", "Industries: collision repair, heavy duty truck, auto body shops -> /", "Products: frame machines, auto body shop tools, fastener removal sets -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Partsmax.com offers thousands of auto body parts... Choose from refurbished, aftermarket, high-performance, and rebuilt auto parts from trusted manufacturers.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated