UPDATE companies SET description='Peak Automation & Electrical, LLC is based in Dickinson, North Dakota. The company operates as a limited liability company providing professional automation and electrical services across the state. No founding year or founders are disclosed in public materials.

The management team cites a combined 75-plus years of automation and electrical experience.

Peak serves industries including cryogenic processing, power generation, salt water disposal, oil and gas production, tank batteries, compressor stations, offshore platforms, chemical processing, and food and beverage manufacturing. Its customer base includes drilling solutions companies and other industrial operators primarily in North Dakota.

The company emphasizes safety as its top priority, maintaining memberships in ISNetworld and PEC, and holds a North Dakota Master Electrician license. It also highlights its Ignition Platform certification as a differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY['Inductive Automation Ignition Platform Certified','ISNetworld Member','PEC Member']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical construction", "Electrical service (24/7/365)", "SCADA development (Ignition platform)", "SCADA commissioning (Cygnet, FactoryTalk, Wonderware, Iconics)", "Flow meter setup, calibration, and maintenance (orifice, magnetic, turbine, mass, Coriolis, LACT)", "Wired, wireless, and radio network instrumentation installation and maintenance", "PLC/DCS/HMI programming and troubleshooting (Allen-Bradley, IDEC, GE, Scadapack, multiple HMI brands)", "Engineering services", "Automation consulting", "Automation standards development (program management, AOI blocks, MOC processes, panel design, FAT/SAT)", "Project documentation (AutoCAD Electrical, cause & effect matrix, control narrative, I/O list)", "Instrumentation installation and maintenance (guided wave radar, float tank sticks, ultrasonic radar, pressure transmitters, level switches, tuning forks, pressure switches)", "LACT unit setup, commissioning, and maintenance", "VFD troubleshooting", "Advanced control systems troubleshooting", "Panel design and I/O layout", "FAT & SAT testing and commissioning", "Cause & effect matrix development", "Control narrative development", "I/O list development", "AutoCAD Electrical drafting", "Program management", "Standard AOI block development", "MOC process development"], "industries": ["Cryogenic processing", "Power generation", "Salt water disposal", "Oil and gas production", "Tank batteries", "Compressor stations", "Offshore platforms", "Chemical processing", "Food and beverage manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Allen-Bradley PLCs", "IDEC PLCs", "GE PLCs", "Scadapack PLCs", "Red Lion HMI", "Proface HMI", "PanelView HMI", "Magelis HMI", "Maple HMI", "Totalflow", "Emerson ROC 800", "Emerson Flossboss 107", "Orifice meters", "Magnetic flow meters", "Turbine flow meters", "Mass flow meters", "Coriolis flow meters", "LACT units", "Guided wave radars", "Float tank sticks", "Ultrasonic radars", "Pressure transmitters", "Liquid level switches", "Level tuning forks", "Pressure switches", "Inductive Automation Ignition platform", "Cygnet SCADA", "FactoryTalk SCADA", "Wonderware SCADA", "Iconics SCADA", "AutoCAD Electrical"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7/365 electrical service availability", "Inductive Automation Ignition Platform certified", "Combined 75+ years of management experience in automation and electrical", "ISNetworld and PEC safety memberships", "North Dakota Master Electrician on record"], "facts_used": ["Location: Dickinson, ND -> db", "Services: electrical construction, electrical service, SCADA development, commissioning, flow meter setup, instrumentation, PLC/DCS/HMI programming, engineering, consulting, documentation -> /", "Industries served: cryogenic processing, power generation, salt water disposal, oil & gas production, tank batteries, compressor stations, offshore platforms, chemical processing, food & beverage manufacturing -> /", "Certifications: Inductive Automation Ignition Platform Certified, North Dakota Master Electrician License, ISNetworld member, PEC member -> /", "Management experience: combined 75+ years -> /", "24/7/365 service -> /", "Contact: PO BOX 1423, Dickinson, ND 58602 -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Peak Automation & Electrical, LLC provides professional services to industry leaders across North Dakota.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='peak-automation-and-electrical' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Pelican Wire operates from Naples, Florida. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or founders.

Pelican Wire is a custom wire shop that produces engineered wire solutions without a standard catalog. Its capabilities include high-flex life wire for robotic motion control, heating wire for fluid transfer systems, resistance wire for aerospace and wind turbine blade mold heating, and fine-gauge wire (40–45 AWG) for aerospace sensors. The company also offers an ON-DEMAND program for immediate shipment of premium wire stock and provides a product design tool kit with size charts, insulation guides, and calculators.

The company serves aerospace and aviation, robotics, radiant flooring (RV, residential, and commercial), automotive (heated seats, fluid transfer, emissions control), autoclave, UAV, cryogenics, medical devices, e-textiles, and wind energy sectors. It has partnered with numerous medical device manufacturers and works with robotics manufacturers on heat transfer and measurement solutions.

