UPDATE companies SET description='Phoenix Solar Panel Systems operates from Phoenix, Arizona, serving the metropolitan area and offering services nationwide through a network of installation partners. The company was founded by Steven Smith, J.D., known as "Solar Steve Esquire," after he worked at several Valley solar companies and observed what he describes as a lack of professionalism and regulation in the industry. Smith established the business to prioritize honesty, integrity, and transparency in residential solar.

The company does not perform installations directly. Instead, it helps homeowners and businesses evaluate solar options — grid-tied systems, off-grid designs, battery backup, and commercial arrays — and connects them with independent, licensed installers. Customers contract directly with the installer for the work. Phoenix Solar Panel Systems also offers home energy audits, solar water heater services, EV charger installation, attic insulation, duct sealing, and solar panel cleaning, removal, and reinstallation.

The firm serves residential homeowners and commercial property owners in Arizona, with a focus on the Phoenix metro area. It works with the state''s major utilities, Arizona Public Service (APS) and Salt River Project (SRP), and guides clients through federal tax credits and Arizona-specific incentives. Commercial clients include businesses seeking to reduce operating costs through solar installations on rooftops or parking structures.

Smith states the company was started to "clean up the residential solar industry" by educating customers rather than selling to them, presenting both positives and negatives of solar ownership. The goal is long-term, mutually beneficial relationships with customers and employees, positioning the business as a consumer advocate in a market the founder characterizes as poorly regulated.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar consulting and system design guidance", "Grid-tied solar system evaluation", "Off-grid solar system design consultation", "Commercial solar project assessment", "Solar battery storage sizing and recommendation", "Home energy audits", "Solar water heater services", "EV charger installation coordination", "Attic insulation and duct sealing", "Solar panel cleaning, bird proofing, removal and reinstallation", "Solar carport and patio cover projects", "Utility interconnection guidance (APS, SRP)", "Federal and Arizona solar incentive navigation"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Renewable energy consulting", "Home energy efficiency", "Electrical contracting (via partner network)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Connects customers with independent, licensed installers rather than installing directly", "Customers contract directly with the installer performing the work", "Focus on education over sales \u2014 presents both positives and negatives of solar", "Guides clients through utility requirements (APS, SRP) and incentive programs", "Offers home energy audits and complementary efficiency services"], "facts_used": ["Founder Steven Smith, J.D. (''Solar Steve Esquire'') -> /about-us", "Company connects customers with independent installers; customers contract directly with installer -> /, /about-us", "Headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona, serves metro area and nationwide -> /, /about-us", "Services: residential solar, off-grid, commercial