UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Gray, Maine, with additional locations in Saco and Brewer, Pine Tree Food Equipment has served commercial kitchens across Maine and New Hampshire for over 35 years. The company operates as a licensed and insured service provider specializing in the repair, maintenance, and installation of commercial foodservice equipment.

