UPDATE companies SET description='Plastech Machining & Fab Inc. operates from Bow, New Hampshire, specializing in precision plastics machining and fabrication. The company focuses on engineering-grade plastics such as Ultem, Delrin, ABS, and Acetal, serving clients from prototype through production volumes.

