UPDATE companies SET description='Plastics Unlimited operates from a 130,000-square-foot facility in Preston, Iowa. The company was founded in 1993 by Terry, Nancy, and Gene Kieffer on their family farm after the physical toll of livestock farming prompted them to seek a less labor-intensive venture. They purchased a used thermoforming machine at auction, installed it in a machine shed, and began producing thermoformed parts.

Today the manufacturer provides custom thermoforming, composites, and urethane molding, supported by in-house design and tooling, CAD services, and robotic CNC trimming. The facility houses multiple thermoforming machines capable of handling both small and large parts, and the company''s proprietary TEC® (Tooless Engineered Composites) process combines plastics and composites to produce Class-A surfaces with reduced tooling. Secondary operations and assembly are also offered.

The company serves agriculture, construction, dunnage, material handling, medical, OEM, outdoor/recreation, aerospace, industrial, and transportation markets.

The founders chose thermoforming for its lower entry cost compared to injection molding and built the business on farming values—planet stewardship, quality, innovation, a can-do attitude, and customer service. Plastics Unlimited emphasizes green innovation, award-winning quality, and faster turnaround times than alternative plastic processes.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thermoforming (heavy-gauge and thin-gauge)", "Composites manufacturing", "Urethane molding", "Design & tooling (in-house)", "CNC robotic part trimming", "CAD services", "Secondary operations and assembly", "TEC\u00ae (Tooless Engineered Composites) process", "Polyurethane plastic products", "Returnable packaging and racking"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Construction", "Dunnage", "Material Handling", "Medical", "OEM", "Outdoor/Rec", "Aerospace", "Industrial", "Transportation"], "materials": ["Thermoplastics", "Polyurethane", "Composite materials"], "equipment": ["CNC routers"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["TEC\u00ae (Tooless Engineered Composites) process for Class-A parts with less tooling", "In-house design and tooling team", "Robotic CNC trimming for precision part finishing", "Faster production turnaround than other plastic processes", "Green innovation and sustainability focus"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993 on Kieffer family farm -> /about-us", "Founders: Terry, Nancy, Gene Kieffer -> /about-us", "130,000 sq ft facility in Preston, IA -> /about-us", "Custom thermoforming, composites, urethane molding -> /about-us", "Industries: Agriculture, Construction, Dunnage, Material Handling, Medical, OEM, Outdoor/Rec, Aerospace, Industrial, Transportation -> /about-us", "TEC\u00ae Tooless Engineered Composites process -> /about-us", "In-house design/tooling team -> /about-us", "Robotic CNC trimming -> /about-us", "Green innovation focus -> /about-us", "Award-winning manufacturer -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_