UPDATE companies SET description='Plastik USA operates from its headquarters in Plainview, New York, while its primary manufacturing takes place in a 400,000-square-foot facility in Ningbo, China. The family-owned company has been in business for over 15 years, building long-term relationships across the food packaging supply chain.

The company specializes in plastic injection molding for food packaging, producing lines that include tamper-evident containers, microwavable containers, multi-compartment containers, soup and pail containers, mineral-filled containers, and paper-based containers in rectangle, oblong, and round formats. Its Ningbo factory houses an in-house mold department and label production line, enabling custom in-mold labeling, logo design, and rapid tooling changes. All products are molded from virgin resin without fillers.

The company emphasizes its US FDA-certified products, virgin-material-only policy, and vertically integrated mold and label capabilities as differentiators, positioning itself as a partner that can move from design to production without external dependencies.', certifications=ARRAY['US FDA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Injection Molding", "Custom Injection Molding", "In-mold Labeling", "Mold Design and Manufacturing", "Label Design and Production", "Custom Packaging Design", "Food Packaging Manufacturing", "Tamper-Evident Container Production", "Microwavable Container Production", "Multi-Compartment Container Production", "Soup and Pail Container Production", "Mineral-Filled Container Production", "Paper-Based Container Production"], "industries": ["Food Packaging", "Food Service", "Packaging"], "materials": ["Virgin Plastic Resin"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["US FDA-certified food packaging products", "400,000 sq ft manufacturing facility in Ningbo, China", "In-house mold making and label production for instant tooling changes", "Virgin resin only, no low-quality fillers", "Custom in-mold labeling and packaging design services"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Plainview, New York -> db", "400,000 sq ft factory in Ningbo, China -> /about-us", "Family-owned with over 15 years experience -> /about-us", "US FDA certificates on products -> /about-us", "In-house mold and label production -> /about-us", "Custom in-mold labeling and logo design -> /about-us", "Virgin resin only, no fillers -> /about-us", "Product lines: tamper evident, microwavable, multi-comp, soup/pail, mineral-filled, paper -> /", "Shapes: rectangle, oblong, round -> /", "Custom injection molding capability -> /", "Branch offices and warehouses in New York, USA -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Our 400,000 square feet state of art facility offers unlimited product production an