UPDATE companies SET description='Polo Packaging operates from Woodbridge, Virginia, as a wholesale manufacturer of custom packaging solutions. The company serves growing brands and businesses across the United States with a focus on quality, consistency, and customization.

The company produces a range of custom packaging styles including rigid boxes, mailer boxes, tuck boxes, folding cartons, and kraft packaging. Production capabilities cover custom printing in up to four colors, coatings such as varnish and lamination, and finishes including matte, glossy, soft touch, and spot UV. Additional services include box inserts, window patching, and free design consultation. Materials used span cardboard, kraft, and rigid board in thicknesses from 10 pt to 48 pt, with eco-friendly and biodegradable options available. The firm reports serving more than 500 companies, though facility size and headcount are not disclosed.

Polo Packaging states it serves almost all major business industries, with specific box types tailored for cosmetics (eyeliner, lip gloss, makeup boxes), candles, jewelry, watches, gifts, and food items such as cupcakes. The company works with both small and large businesses, offering low minimum order quantities and bulk discounts.

The company differentiates itself through free shipping on all orders, no die or plate charges, quick turnaround times, and a four-step process from box style selection through design, production, and delivery. Sustainable packaging options are emphasized, with kraft boxes highlighted for brands focused on minimal environmental impact.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom box manufacturing", "Custom printing (1-4 color)", "Coating (varnish, lamination)", "Finishing (matte, glossy, soft touch, spot UV)", "Box insert installation", "Window patching", "Design consultation"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Cardboard", "Kraft", "Rigid board", "Recyclable materials", "Biodegradable materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free shipping on all orders", "Free design consultation", "Low minimum order quantities", "Quick turnaround times", "No die and plate charges"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Woodbridge, Virginia -> db", "Wholesale manufacturer of custom packaging -> /", "Offers rigid boxes, mailer boxes, tuck boxes, folding cartons, kraft packaging -> /", "Custom printing up to 4 colors -> /", "Coatings: varnish, lamination; finishes: matte, glossy, soft touch, spot UV -> /", "Box inserts and window patching available -> /", "Materials: cardboard, kraft, rigid board (10 pt to 48 pt) -> /", "Eco-friendly and biodegradable materials offered -> /", "Serves 500+ companies -> /", "Free shipping, free design consultation, low MOQ, quick turnarounds, no die/plate charges, bulk discounts, no hidden charges -> /", "Four-step process: box style, design preparation, production, delivery -> /", "Box types for cosmetics, candles, jewelry, gifts, food -> /", "Sustainable packaging emphasized -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Packaging Solutions | Wholesale Manufacturer | Polo Packaging", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "mi