UPDATE companies SET description='PolymerPak, LLC operates from Exeter, California, producing sustainable food packaging containers for the North American market. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure in its public materials, and no founders are named on its website.

The line includes containers for salads, pastas, desserts, meals, produce, and prepared foods, with attention to seal integrity and clarity for retail display.

PolymerPak serves three primary channels: food processors who pack branded refrigerated and frozen items; food-service distributors that resell cases to restaurants, bakeries, and small grocers; and retail chains — grocery and warehouse stores — that stock the containers in produce, deli, and frozen aisles. The company notes that "food industry giants" purchase its packaging for consumer-facing products.

The stated differentiator is a sustainability model that continuously collects, reprocesses, and remanufactures PET, reducing landfill waste and preserving resources.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thermoformed sustainable food container manufacturing", "PET recycling and reprocessing", "Container design with secure seals and high clarity", "Post-consumer recycled content integration"], "industries": ["Food processing", "Food service distribution", "Retail grocery and warehouse"], "materials": ["PET plastic", "Post-consumer recycled PET"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["70% post-consumer recycled PET content", "90 million pounds of PET recycled annually", "1 billion PET bottles recycled to date", "Closed-loop recycle\u2013redesign\u2013recycle\u2013repeat cycle", "Serves foodservice, retail, and distribution markets across North America"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Exeter, California -> db", "Business: sustainable food packaging containers -> /", "Markets: Food Processors, Food Service Distribution, Retail -> /", "Materials: PET, 70% post-consumer recycled content -> /", "Scale stats: 1 billion PET bottles recycled, 90 million lbs PET/year -> /", "Customer examples: food processors (salads, pastas, desserts, meals), distributors (restaurants, bakeries, small grocers), retail (grocery/warehouse stores) -> /", "Sustainability mission: recycle-redesign-recycle-repeat cycle -> /", "No founding year, ownership, founders, certifications, equipment, employee count, lead times, tolerances, volume range, CAGE code, min order, export compliance, languages, or social links found in INPUT -> /, /about, /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Innovator of sustainable food packaging for the foodservice, retail, and distribution markets throughout North America. PolymerPak supplies three major markets: Food Processors, Food Service Distribution & Reta