UPDATE companies SET description='Portugal Woodworks LLC operates from Lehi, Utah, serving the Greater Salt Lake City corridor from Ogden to Provo and the Park City Summit region. The company’s founding year, ownership structure, and founders are not disclosed in public materials.

The shop provides interior remodeling, custom cabinetry, furniture and antique restoration, and custom closet solutions. Core processes include cabinet making, furniture repair and refinishing, drywall installation, interior painting, custom baseboard and crown molding fabrication, and specialty hardware installation. Facility size, headcount, annual volumes, and part-number counts are not published.

The company cites kitchen, closet, and entertainment-center cabinetry as typical project types, along with whole-room remodels and piece-by-piece furniture restoration.

Portugal Woodworks emphasizes “unmatched craftsmanship and attention to detail” and “expert craftsmanship and dedication to quality” as its distinguishing attributes, and it offers free on-site estimates to prospective clients.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet making", "Cabinet refinishing", "Furniture restoration", "Antique furniture repair", "Custom closet systems", "Interior remodeling", "Drywall installation", "Interior painting", "Custom baseboard fabrication", "Crown molding fabrication", "Specialty hardware installation"], "industries": ["Residential remodeling", "Commercial remodeling", "Custom cabinetry", "Furniture restoration"], "materials": ["Wood", "Specialty hardware"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Unmatched craftsmanship and attention to detail", "Expert craftsmanship and dedication to quality", "Service across Greater Salt Lake City from Ogden to Park City", "Free on-site estimates"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Portugal Woodworks LLC -> db", "Headquarters: Lehi, Utah -> db", "Service area: Greater Salt Lake City (Ogden to Provo, Park City Summit) -> /", "Services: interior remodeling, custom cabinetry, furniture restoration, custom closets -> /", "Specific capabilities: drywall, painting, custom baseboard, crown molding, specialty hardware installation -> /", "Phone:  -> /", "Website: portugalwoodworks.com -> db", "Differentiators: unmatched craftsmanship, expert craftsmanship, free estimates -> /", "Customer locations: Heber, Park City, Sandy, Lehi, Spanish Fork, Alpine, Draper, etc. -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "custom cabinet making services", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='portugal-woodworks-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Power Control Services is based in Broussard, Louisiana. The company traces its roots to 1996 when Walter Bergeron founded Synergy Technologies in his backyard.

The firm specializes in industrial electronic repair and rebuild, servomotor repair, and component-level restoration of automation equipment such as AC/DC drives, servo drives, PLCs, power supplies, and industrial displays. Technicians work at ESD- and SMT-equipped repair stations using a proactive process that replaces failed parts with high-reliability components and applies protective coatings for future serviceability. The shop offers snapshot reporting, in-service warranty coverage, and technical support, serving customers nationwide through a network of industrial distributors.

Its customer base spans power generation (Entergy), food processing (Tyson Foods, Coca‑Cola), oil and gas (Parker Drilling, NOV, Transocean, Halliburton, Schlumberger), chemical manufacturing (Dow), and major end users such as ConocoPhillips in Alaska and Disney World in Florida. The company also partners with regional and national distributors to extend its reach.

