UPDATE companies SET description='Prairie Plastics Holdings operates from Sun Prairie, Wisconsin, where it was founded in 1998 as a custom thermoforming specialist. In 2016, Marine Corps veteran Jim Cavezza and Jason Zajicek assumed management as managing partners, bringing decades of thermoforming experience from PendaForm and Fabri-Form. Cavezza, honorably discharged as a sergeant and a reservist from 1999 to 2005, focuses on rapid customer response, while Zajicek oversees manufacturing operations and lean development.

The company provides design, prototyping, single- and twin-sheet thermoforming, CNC trimming, assembly, and kitting. Its product range includes wheel packs, sleeve packs, plastic pallets, returnable packaging, and custom components. Prairie Plastics serves both high-volume and smaller-volume orders, emphasizing a full-service approach that covers engineering, material selection, development efficiency, and shipping logistics.

Customers span industries requiring thermoformed solutions, particularly in returnable packaging and custom component manufacturing. The firm works with clients who need competitively priced, quality parts on compressed timelines, offering an alternative to larger consolidators that have extended lead times. Its service model is built around eliminating status uncertainty, with project updates provided throughout production.

The owners cite a culture of "serving at the pleasure of the customer" as their differentiator, rooted in fast quote turnaround (hours, not days), transparent communication, and anticipating issues before they arise. This mindset, they say, has earned loyal customers who value the personal experience over the scale of larger thermoformers.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom thermoforming", "Design", "Prototyping", "Single-sheet thermoforming", "Twin-sheet thermoforming", "CNC trimming", "Assembly", "Kitting", "Returnable packaging design", "Material selection consulting", "Shipping and logistics planning"], "industries": ["Thermoforming", "Returnable packaging", "Custom components", "Material handling", "Plastics manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "5-6 weeks after order acknowledgment", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quote responses in hours, not days or weeks", "Product running in 5-6 weeks after order acknowledgment", "Continuous project status updates", "Single- and twin-sheet thermoforming capability", "Veteran-owned leadership with Marine Corps experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1998 -> /about-us", "Located in Sun Prairie, Wisconsin -> /about-us, db", "Jim Cavezza and Jason Zajicek assumed management in 2016 -> /about-us", "Jim Cavezza is Marine Corps veteran (sergeant, reservist 1999-2005) -> /about-us", "Services: design, prototyping, single- and twin-sheet manufacturing, CNC trim, assembly, kitting -> /about-us", "Products: wheel packs, sleeve packs, pallets, returnable packaging, custom components -> /", "Lead time: 5-6 weeks after order acknowledged -> db, /", "Quote response in hours -> /", "Project updates provided -> /", "Serves high-volume and smaller-volume customers -> /about-us", "Energy policy -> /about-us", "Thermoforming plastic recycling -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "we provide design, prototyping, sing