UPDATE companies SET description='Metal Art operates from Eldridge, Iowa, where it produces custom metal artwork ranging from collegiate logos and military badges to fire pits and decorative signs. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, though it emphasizes domestic production with a "Made In America" label and partners with the veteran-support organization Metal4Valor.

The shop fabricates three-dimensional welded metal pieces, including mascot sculptures, fire pits, badges, medallions, and monogrammed signs. Products on offer feature licenses from universities such as Wisconsin, Iowa State, and Nebraska, as well as branding for Anheuser-Busch, World of Outlaws, and Shelby Cobra. Custom orders typically ship in three to four weeks, and the company cites over 40 five-star reviews on Google and Facebook.

The Fraternal Order of Police, city fire departments, and collegiate athletic programs appear among the referenced clients.

