UPDATE companies SET description='Plastics operates from Omaha, Nebraska, where President Ted Sondgeroth leads the company. The business focuses on business-to-business injection molding services, offering flexible, adaptable, and scalable solutions for customers ranging from those with no molding experience to large companies with their own in-house molding operations.

