UPDATE companies SET description='Prime Source Foods operates from its headquarters in Londonderry, New Hampshire, with additional distribution facilities in East Windsor, Connecticut, and a cross-dock in Vassalboro, Maine. The company has been independently owned for more than 60 years, establishing itself as a center-of-the-plate food distributor across New England and eastern New York.

