UPDATE companies SET description='ProStock Automotive is headquartered in Saddle Brook, New Jersey, and operates a network of twelve locations across northern New Jersey and western Connecticut. The locally owned company has served the professional installer market for over 30 years, building a reputation for reliable parts supply across the tri-state area.

